               \usepackage{upgreek}
               \setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
               \begin{document}$O({\mid\!{V}\!\mid}^3)$\end{document}, that its output game is independent of the order in which attractors are computed, and that it solves all Büchi games.},
  author    = {Huth, Michael and Kuo, Jim Huan-Pu and Piterman, Nir},
  address   = {Berlin, Heidelberg},
  booktitle = {Foundations of Software Science and Computation Structures},
